o if I look I did everything  I can in my powers to say when they were  younger look these are the pitfalls  these are the pitfalls and the  are the pitfalls and then they both  decided like you know we're gonna do it  anyway so I have to support them I would  be a hypocrite if I didn't and you know  what you know we're here once that we  know of go for the go for the gold right  you got to do it and with you as a mom  it doesn't seem like you've had very  many pitfalls lots of successes oh thank  you very much I mean we've had our  moments but overall I'm happy and proud  of my girls and I think that they are  nice people and they are kind people and  I think that's the greatest compliment I  can give them  [Music]
 

